{
    "title": "Weather Radar Live Map",
    "description": "Weather Radar Live Map is your all-in-one weather tracker, putting powerful tools right at your fingertips. Keep current with important weather changes using:\r\n\r\nReal-time radar images: Track precipitation movement and make informed predictions based on animated radar loops for the last 40 minutes.\r\nCustomizable overlays: Choose between rain radar, other weather overlays, and adjust opacity for optimal viewing.\r\nDetailed weather forecasts: Get today's weather, a 7-day local forecast, and hourly forecasts for the next 14 days.\r\nPrecipitation forecast: View a 72-hour precipitation forecast map to plan your activities.\r\nTemperature forecast map: Stay informed with a visual representation of upcoming temperature changes.\r\nUnparalleled Radar Features:\r\n\r\nAccurate US radar data: Track rain, snow, and mixed precipitation right on your phone.\r\nMultiple loop speeds: Choose the most convenient speed for viewing radar movements.\r\nCustomizable background maps: Select the best base map for your needs.\r\nStay Informed and Safe:\r\n\r\nWeather alerts: Receive push notifications for bookmarked locations, including storm alerts, tornado warnings, and more.\r\nInteractive National Weather Service alerts: View watches, warnings, and alerts directly on the map.\r\nHurricane & tropical storm tracker: Stay informed about upcoming storms.\r\nLightning tracker: Be aware of potential lightning strikes in your area.\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n\r\nSatellite cloud cover: View cloud cover as seen from space.\r\nCurrent & forecast weather details: Get current temperature, highs and lows, \"Feels Like\" temperature, pressure, humidity, wind speed & direction, visibility, dew point, and chance of precipitation.\r\nBookmarked locations: Easily track weather for multiple locations.\r\nSunrise & sunset times: Plan your day with sunrise and sunset information.\r\nNo Ads: Enjoy an ad-free weather experience.\r\nGo beyond basic weather apps with Weather Radar Live Map. Download it today and experience the power of real-time weather tracking!\r\n\r\nRadar coverage: This app provides radar images for the US (including most of Alaska, Hawaii, and its territories), Mexico (northern), Canada (southern), Australia, many European countries, Japan, and more. See the full list on the developer's website.\r\n\r\nPrecipitation and temperature forecasts, snow depth forecast maps, and satellite maps are available for most of the world. Hurricane tracking, wildfire trackers, and lightning trackers also cover a large portion of the globe.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Weather Radar Live Map is your all-in-one weather tracker, putting powerful tools right at your fingertips. Keep current with important weather changes using:<br><br>Real-time radar images: Track precipitation movement and make informed predictions based on animated radar loops for the last 40 minutes.<br>Customizable overlays: Choose between rain radar, other weather overlays, and adjust opacity for optimal viewing.<br>Detailed weather forecasts: Get today&#39;s weather, a 7-day local forecast, and hourly forecasts for the next 14 days.<br>Precipitation forecast: View a 72-hour precipitation forecast map to plan your activities.<br>Temperature forecast map: Stay informed with a visual representation of upcoming temperature changes.<br>Unparalleled Radar Features:<br><br>Accurate US radar data: Track rain, snow, and mixed precipitation right on your phone.<br>Multiple loop speeds: Choose the most convenient speed for viewing radar movements.<br>Customizable background maps: Select the best base map for your needs.<br>Stay Informed and Safe:<br><br>Weather alerts: Receive push notifications for bookmarked locations, including storm alerts, tornado warnings, and more.<br>Interactive National Weather Service alerts: View watches, warnings, and alerts directly on the map.<br>Hurricane &amp; tropical storm tracker: Stay informed about upcoming storms.<br>Lightning tracker: Be aware of potential lightning strikes in your area.<br>Additional Features:<br><br>Satellite cloud cover: View cloud cover as seen from space.<br>Current &amp; forecast weather details: Get current temperature, highs and lows, &quot;Feels Like&quot; temperature, pressure, humidity, wind speed &amp; direction, visibility, dew point, and chance of precipitation.<br>Bookmarked locations: Easily track weather for multiple locations.<br>Sunrise &amp; sunset times: Plan your day with sunrise and sunset information.<br>No Ads: Enjoy an ad-free weather experience.<br>Go beyond basic weather apps with Weather Radar Live Map. Download it today and experience the power of real-time weather tracking!<br><br>Radar coverage: This app provides radar images for the US (including most of Alaska, Hawaii, and its territories), Mexico (northern), Canada (southern), Australia, many European countries, Japan, and more. See the full list on the developer&#39;s website.<br><br>Precipitation and temperature forecasts, snow depth forecast maps, and satellite maps are available for most of the world. Hurricane tracking, wildfire trackers, and lightning trackers also cover a large portion of the globe.",
